# Transport layer II.b: entrywise calculus of matrix-valued fields (ATLAS-II)

`pdM i A y` is the matrix of slice derivatives `pd i (A · a b) y` of a matrix field `A : Pt n → Matrix`
(B3 class B: a notation wrapper over `pd`, bridge `pdM_apply` is `rfl`). `SmoothOn A U` says every entry
